  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You may have been infused with magic, but you have evolved with the natural weapons bats had as animals. When you select this feat, you gain either a Wing or a Bite unarmed attack. These attacks are in the </span>Brawling weapon group.</p><ul><li><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\">Wing, 1d6 Bludgeoning [grapple, unarmed]</p></li><li><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\">Bite, 1d6 piercing [backstabber, unarmed]</p></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">At 5th level, whenever you get a critical hit with one of these attacks, you get its critical specialization effect.</span></p>"
